// cosmic-sumiday - Telegram Desktop colour scheme for the COSMIC Sumi Day rice
// Paper, ink text, moss accent, lichen for online / outgoing / success,
// vermilion only where Telegram marks something wrong.
// Build the theme file with ./build.sh, then in Telegram:
// Settings -> Chat Settings -> Chat wallpaper -> Choose from file.
// Generated from the rice palette over Telegram's night theme (v7.3.1 keyset).
// Keys left out keep Telegram's own colours
// (calls, group calls, statistics charts, premium, credits).
